        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: University of New South Wales, Purbanchal University\n- Places: Kensington, Sydney, New South Wales, Australia, Nepal\n- Topics: university establishment, public research universities, university rankings\n\nFacts:\n- The University of New South Wales was established in 1949.\n- Purbanchal University was established in 1993 by the government of Nepal.\n- The University of New South Wales is an Australian public research university located in Kensington, a suburb of Sydney.\n- The University of New South Wales is branded as UNSW Sydney and abbreviated as UNSW.\n- In the 2017 QS World University Rankings, the University of New South Wales was ranked 3rd in Australia, 45th in the world, and 1st in New South Wales.\n- The University of New South Wales is regarded as one of the world's leading universities.",
